{"id":98,"slug":"98-z-index-hoat-dong-the-nao","category":"CSS","subcategory":"Display & Position","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Z-index hoạt động thế nào?","question_en":"How does z-index work?","answer_vi":"`z-index` quyết định thứ tự xếp chồng, nhưng **chỉ so sánh được giữa các element cùng một stacking context**.\n\n```css\n.modal   { position: fixed; z-index: 100; }\n.tooltip { position: absolute; z-index: 10; }\n```\n\nHai điều kiện để `z-index` có tác dụng: element phải **`position` khác `static`**, hoặc là **flex/grid item** (trường hợp này `z-index` chạy mà không cần position).\n\nVì sao `z-index: 9999` vẫn bị che — vì tổ tiên của nó đã tạo một stacking context có mức thấp hơn:\n\n```html\n<div style=\"transform: translateZ(0); z-index: 1; position: relative\">\n  <div style=\"z-index: 9999; position: absolute\">Vẫn nằm dưới .sibling</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2\" class=\"sibling\">Trên</div>\n```\n\nCon không bao giờ vượt ra khỏi thứ hạng của cha — `9999` chỉ có nghĩa **bên trong** cha đó.\n\n```css\n/* tạo stacking context có chủ đích, không cần z-index */\n.card { isolation: isolate; }\n```\n\n**Cách debug:** trong DevTools, mở panel Layers hoặc kiểm tra từng tổ tiên xem có `transform`, `filter`, `opacity < 1`, `will-change`, `contain` hay không — đó là danh sách thủ phạm thường gặp.\n\n**Chốt:** đừng chạy đua số. Dùng thang bậc cố định (10/100/1000) và `isolation: isolate` để nhốt z-index trong từng component","answer_en":"`z-index` sets the stacking order, but it **only compares elements inside the same stacking context**.\n\n```css\n.modal   { position: fixed; z-index: 100; }\n.tooltip { position: absolute; z-index: 10; }\n```\n\nTwo ways for `z-index` to apply: the element has **`position` other than `static`**, or it is a **flex/grid item** (where `z-index` works without positioning).\n\nWhy `z-index: 9999` can still sit underneath — because an ancestor established a lower-ranked stacking context:\n\n```html\n<div style=\"transform: translateZ(0); z-index: 1; position: relative\">\n  <div style=\"z-index: 9999; position: absolute\">Still below .sibling</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2\" class=\"sibling\">On top</div>\n```\n\nA child never escapes its parent's rank — `9999` only means anything **within** that parent.\n\n```css\n/* create a stacking context deliberately, without z-index */\n.card { isolation: isolate; }\n```\n\n**How to debug:** open the Layers panel in DevTools, or walk the ancestors looking for `transform`, `filter`, `opacity < 1`, `will-change` or `contain` — that is the usual suspect list.\n\n**Takeaway:** stop escalating numbers. Use a fixed scale (10/100/1000) and `isolation: isolate` to keep z-index contained per component","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>z-index</code> quyết định thứ tự xếp chồng, nhưng <strong>chỉ so sánh được giữa các element cùng một stacking context</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".modal   { position: fixed; z-index: 100; }\n.tooltip { position: absolute; z-index: 10; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.modal</span>   { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">position</span>: fixed; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">z-index</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">100</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.tooltip</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">position</span>: absolute; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">z-index</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>; }</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Hai điều kiện để <code>z-index</code> có tác dụng: element phải <strong><code>position</code> khác <code>static</code></strong>, hoặc là <strong>flex/grid item</strong> (trường hợp này <code>z-index</code> chạy mà không cần position).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Vì sao <code>z-index: 9999</code> vẫn bị che — vì tổ tiên của nó đã tạo một stacking context có mức thấp hơn:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;div style=&quot;transform: translateZ(0); z-index: 1; position: relative&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div style=&quot;z-index: 9999; position: absolute&quot;&gt;Vẫn nằm dưới .sibling&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=&quot;position: relative; z-index: 2&quot; class=&quot;sibling&quot;&gt;Trên&lt;/div&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;transform: translateZ(0); z-index: 1; position: relative&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;z-index: 9999; position: absolute&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Vẫn nằm dưới .sibling<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;position: relative; z-index: 2&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;sibling&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Trên<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Con không bao giờ vượt ra khỏi thứ hạng của cha — <code>9999</code> chỉ có nghĩa <strong>bên trong</strong> cha đó.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"/* tạo stacking context có chủ đích, không cần z-index */\n.card { isolation: isolate; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* tạo stacking context có chủ đích, không cần z-index */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.card</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">isolation</span>: isolate; }</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Cách debug:</strong> trong DevTools, mở panel Layers hoặc kiểm tra từng tổ tiên xem có <code>transform</code>, <code>filter</code>, <code>opacity &lt; 1</code>, <code>will-change</code>, <code>contain</code> hay không — đó là danh sách thủ phạm thường gặp.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Chốt:</strong> đừng chạy đua số. Dùng thang bậc cố định (10/100/1000) và <code>isolation: isolate</code> để nhốt z-index trong từng component.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>z-index</code> sets the stacking order, but it <strong>only compares elements inside the same stacking context</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".modal   { position: fixed; z-index: 100; }\n.tooltip { position: absolute; z-index: 10; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.modal</span>   { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">position</span>: fixed; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">z-index</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">100</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.tooltip</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">position</span>: absolute; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">z-index</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>; }</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Two ways for <code>z-index</code> to apply: the element has <strong><code>position</code> other than <code>static</code></strong>, or it is a <strong>flex/grid item</strong> (where <code>z-index</code> works without positioning).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Why <code>z-index: 9999</code> can still sit underneath — because an ancestor established a lower-ranked stacking context:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;div style=&quot;transform: translateZ(0); z-index: 1; position: relative&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div style=&quot;z-index: 9999; position: absolute&quot;&gt;Still below .sibling&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=&quot;position: relative; z-index: 2&quot; class=&quot;sibling&quot;&gt;On top&lt;/div&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;transform: translateZ(0); z-index: 1; position: relative&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;z-index: 9999; position: absolute&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Still below .sibling<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;position: relative; z-index: 2&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;sibling&quot;</span>&gt;</span>On top<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>A child never escapes its parent's rank — <code>9999</code> only means anything <strong>within</strong> that parent.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"/* create a stacking context deliberately, without z-index */\n.card { isolation: isolate; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* create a stacking context deliberately, without z-index */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.card</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">isolation</span>: isolate; }</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>How to debug:</strong> open the Layers panel in DevTools, or walk the ancestors looking for <code>transform</code>, <code>filter</code>, <code>opacity &lt; 1</code>, <code>will-change</code> or <code>contain</code> — that is the usual suspect list.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Takeaway:</strong> stop escalating numbers. Use a fixed scale (10/100/1000) and <code>isolation: isolate</code> to keep z-index contained per component.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — z-index","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/z-index"},{"label":"MDN — Stacking context","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_positioned_layout/Stacking_context"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/96-position-property-co-nhung-gia-tri-nao","title":"Position property có những giá trị nào?"},{"url":"/q/97-position-sticky-hoat-dong-the-nao","title":"Position sticky hoạt động thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/99-stacking-context-la-gi","title":"Stacking context là gì?"},{"url":"/q/77-cascade-trong-css-nghia-la-gi","title":"Cascade trong CSS nghĩa là gì?"},{"url":"/q/79-inheritance-trong-css-la-gi","title":"Inheritance trong CSS là gì?"},{"url":"/q/80-don-vi-px-em-rem-vw-vh-khac-nhau","title":"Đơn vị px, em, rem, %, vw, vh khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/81-important-dung-khi-nao-tai-sao-nen-tranh","title":"!important dùng khi nào? Tại sao nên tránh?"},{"url":"/q/87-has-selector-la-gi","title":":has() selector là gì?"}]}